('Photographs AI can use','Three views, one observation',[
('Whole plant','Include the container and distribution of the concern. A close-up alone cannot establish whether a change affects one leaf or the whole plant.'),('Detail','Use even light, steady the phone, tap to focus, and inspect the saved image at full size. Keep the relevant edge or vein inside the frame.'),('Comparison','Use the same plant area, distance and lighting at the next observation. Record any change in camera or light conditions.'),('Quality check','Accept: the feature is in focus and visible. Retake: motion blur, colored-light cast, clipped feature or deep shadow. Do not ask AI to recover detail that the image never captured.')]),
