('Reusable prompt cards','Copy, fill, review',[
('Photo review','Review [labeled images] for [specific feature]. Describe visible evidence, then possible interpretations. State what cannot be determined. Ask for missing facts before suggesting actions.'),('Record cleanup','Convert [notes] into a table with date, plant, observation, value, unit and source. Preserve exact values. Use unknown for missing fields. Do not infer measurements.'),('Comparison','Compare [record A] and [record B]. Identify changes in method first. Separate comparable observations from non-comparable ones. Do not claim a trend from inadequate evidence.'),('Weekly summary','Summarize only these reviewed records. List changes, stable observations, missing data and next checks. Cite the record date for every factual claim.')]),
